{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_216_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_216","textTraditional":"一、三年，春，王正月，公如晉，至河乃復。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_216_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_216","textTraditional":"二、三月，辛卯，邾子穿卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_216_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_216","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_216_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_216","textTraditional":"四、秋，葬邾莊公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_216_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_216","textTraditional":"五、冬，仲孫何忌及邾子盟於拔。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}